# The libxml2 2.4.22 ground truth is converted from the SARIF FSE'23 replication
# package (github.com/anonymous2f4a9d/SARIF_FSE23, "Labeled/libxml2-2.4.22-GT.json"),
# an anonymous repository that carries NO LICENSE file — all-rights-reserved by default
# (eval §5.4 / P§19.6). The converted reference is therefore LOCAL-ONLY and must NOT be
# committed to the redistributable replication package; the retrieval URL + converter
# in provenance.json (committed) make it reproducible in one command.
*
!.gitignore
!provenance.json
# The RQ6 real-history rater worksheets (eval §8.3) live here, TRACKED: filled labels are
# human artifacts (the §14.2 carve-out) and are not the withheld reference — they carry
# only build-target ids and commit hints.
!history/
!history/**
